## Read the status {% #status %}

The {% ui key="client:module.status" /%} card shows what the plugin is doing now. For example, **Watching** a number of **castles for attacks by players** means all is quiet. **Nothing could protect the troops of** a castle means the station and the gates both failed. Open the logs to see why.

## Related errors {% #errors %}

[CASTLE_LOCKED](/errors/#castle-locked) shows when an attack plugin wants to attack from a castle while Auto Station moves its troops out. Wait. Attacks from the castle start again by themselves.
